    "background_story": "Zayd was a brilliant and resourceful adventurer who lived in the 19th century. He made a name for himself as a skilled explorer, known for his ability to navigate treacherous terrain and find creative solutions to complex problems. When a devastating drought hit the land, Zayd was tasked with leading an expedition to find a new source of water for the parched village. With time of the essence, he employed his expertise in expedience, using his knowledge of the land and his quick thinking to chart the most efficient course. By taking calculated risks and leveraging the skills of his team, Zayd successfully located a hidden oasis, saving the village from certain disaster. His reputation as a master of expedience spread far and wide, earning him a place in the annals of history as a hero of ingenuity and speed.",
